Comments:       WARNING
                Install script assumes you may have loaded the wrong python version
                before loading this TCE. So I break and re-link python3.14 to python3
                Either reboot to use older pythons or after using this TCE, use root powers
                to break my link and relink either python3.6 or python3.9 to python3
                ALSO you may need to remove this TCE from boot list if you are using
                TCEs that rely on older pythons

                For movie--without ffmpeg7 to merge video and audio into a webm file, 
                you will have a video file (mp4) with no audio and an audio file (webm) 
                with no video. Hence the need for large ffmpeg7 dependency.
                
                video+audio $ yt-dlp <url>
                audio only  $ yt-dlp -x <url>
              
                If your player can not play webm or opus or use $ ffplay
                $ ffmpeg -i filename.webm filename.mp4
                $ ffmpeg -i filename.opus filename.mp3
              
